        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4857, Traditional Lines and Crosses Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA fantastic example of old world beauty, the lines and crosses featured on this Ribbon and Reed 12 Inch Door Pull is iconic of French Colonial decor. It is great for use as a door handle or an appliance pull. Available in 6 finishes. Comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/french-colonial-ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international-cp-856\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/crossed-indian-drum-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-757\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/ornate-edge-cabinet-pull-rosette-rk-international-bp-384\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull Rosette</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4857 Ribbon and Reed Door Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
